# =============================================================================
# PAD-Stream V15-SG7C
# Frozen PI-RNN Deployment on SGSim Streamlines
#
# NO TRAINING.
# NO ARCHITECTURE CHANGE.
# NO GRID MAP-BACK YET.
#
#
# PURPOSE
# -------
# Deploy the frozen V15-SG7B full-physics PI-RNN onto the heterogeneous
# SGSim streamline time-of-flight database generated by V15-SG6.
#
#
# TRANSPORT HANDOFF
# -----------------
#
# For streamline ell:
#
#       xi = tau / tau_end,ell
#
# and at physical reservoir time t:
#
#       tD_ell(t) = t / tau_end,ell
#
#
# Therefore:
#
#       S_ell(xi,t)
#           =
#       PI-RNN(
#           xi,
#           tD_ell(t)
#       )
#
#
# Heterogeneity is carried by:
#
#       streamline geometry
#       streamline flow weight
#       tau_end
#       producer connectivity
#
# while the frozen full-physics saturation operator is carried by SG7B.
#
#
# CLASSICAL REFERENCE
# -------------------
#
# Frozen SG7A master_saturation is interpolated at exactly the same
# streamline-specific tD values.
#
#
# THIS MILESTONE VALIDATES
# ------------------------
#
#   frozen-model identity
#   SG6/SG7B interface
#   physical-time -> streamline-tD transformation
#   PI-RNN deployment on 1,078 streamlines
#   agreement with SG7A
#   flow-weighted agreement
#   producer-response agreement
#
#
# NEXT MILESTONE
# --------------
#
# V15-SG7D:
# Conservative streamline-to-grid saturation map-back
#
# =============================================================================


